Hello World Souffle.

This recipe prints Hello World! to the console.

Ingredients.
72 g heaping pieces of chocolate
101 g sugar
108 g flour
111 g baking powder
32 g butter
87 g cocoa powder
114 g vanilla extract
100 g milk
33 g sprinkles

Method.
Put heaping pieces of chocolate into mixing bowl.
Put sugar into mixing bowl.
Put flour into mixing bowl.
Put flour into mixing bowl.
Put baking powder into mixing bowl.
Put butter into mixing bowl.
Put cocoa powder into mixing bowl.
Put baking powder into mixing bowl.
Put vanilla extract into mixing bowl.
Put flour into mixing bowl.
Put milk into mixing bowl.
Put sprinkles into mixing bowl.
Pour contents of mixing bowl into baking dish.

Serves 1.
